      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PACKHAM UP (2) rocketed out of the boxes with a strong early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (22.39) at Ballarat over 390m. The form from his last run stacks up well. Sure to be about the mark. WHERE'S LOGAN (7) is yet to break through in seven starts but has run a number of placings. Was in the placings again last time finishing second (17.07) at Healesville. Form from his last run is proving strong. Expecting another good run. NO MAN'S LAND (3) was in trouble close to the inside last time over 425m at Bendigo and failed to finish. Must include in calculations. MOHINGA HOPPY (1) is a newcomer from the Russell Edwards kennel. Gets every chance from the inside draw. Profiles nicely and can feature in the finish.",
